   * `sizeSelectorUnavailable` AND-ed with `isUnavailable`) — previously only ever verified at the
   * recipe-reaction level (a manually-constructed input into `ZimmProductCardRecipe.baseStyle`
   * directly), never proven that index.tsx itself computes that input correctly for a real
